    "title": "Woman arrested, two suspects sought after Waianae armed robbery - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kayli Pascal-Martinez ,\n8 hours ago WAIANAE, Hawaii (Island News) – An investigation is underway following an apparent armed robbery incident that occurred in Waianae on Wednesday morning. The Honolulu Police Department (HPD) reported that the incident happened at approximately 6:20 a.m. when a 34-year-old man, who was working in Waianae, was approached by two masked suspects. They brandished handguns and demanded the man’s keys. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
